---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout title="Privacy Policy">
  <div class="page-shell">
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1 class="page-title">
        <span class="text-white">Privacy</span>
        <span class="text-gold">Policy</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="page-kicker">Last updated: November 2, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="nugzz-card p-6 md:p-8 space-y-6 text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Official Nugzz Crew (“we,” “us,” or “the Site”) operates
        officialnugzzcrew.com. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use,
        and protect information when you visit the Site or choose to sign in
        with Google/YouTube or link a Discord account.
      </p>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-header uppercase tracking-wide text-lg mb-2">
          Information We Collect
        </h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li>
            <strong>Google / YouTube sign-in:</strong> name, email address, profile
            picture, and YouTube channel information (channel ID, channel name, and
            avatar) when you grant the <code>youtube.readonly</code> scope.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Discord linking:</strong> Discord username, Discord ID, email
            address, and avatar when you link your Discord account.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Automatically collected:</strong> standard server logs (IP address,
            browser type, pages visited, timestamps). We do not use advertising cookies
            or third-party trackers beyond what is required for authentication.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Optional:</strong> any information you voluntarily submit through
            the contact form or community features.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We only request the minimum scopes needed to identify you for live
          stream chat, command features, and DMO ticket integration.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-header uppercase tracking-wide text-lg mb-2">
          How We Use Your Information
        </h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li>To sign you in and display your identity on the Site</li>
          <li>
            To associate your YouTube channel with live stream chat and command
            features
          </li>
          <li>To link your Discord account for DMO ticket creation</li>
          <li>To operate, maintain, and improve the Site</li>
          <li>To respond to contact form submissions</li>
          <li>To prevent abuse and enforce our Terms of Service</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. We do not
          use your data for advertising.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-header uppercase tracking-wide text-lg mb-2">
          Third-Party Services
        </h2>
        <p>
          Authentication is handled through Google and Discord. When you sign in
          or link an account, you are subject to their privacy policies:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 mt-2">
          <li>
            Google: <a
              href="https://policies.google.com/privacy"
              class="text-gold hover:underline"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener">policies.google.com/privacy</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            YouTube: <a
              href="https://www.youtube.com/t/terms"
              class="text-gold hover:underline"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener">youtube.com/t/terms</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            Discord: <a
              href="https://discord.com/privacy"
              class="text-gold hover:underline"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener">discord.com/privacy</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We receive only the information those services explicitly provide
          based on the scopes you approve. YouTube channel data is used solely
          to identify you in stream interactions and is stored only in your
          browser.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-header uppercase tracking-wide text-lg mb-2">
          Data Retention & Security
        </h2>
        <p>
          Account data is retained only as long as your session is active or as
          needed to provide the linked features. You may request deletion of
          your data at any time by using the contact form. We use reasonable
          technical measures to protect information, but no method of
          transmission over the internet is 100% secure.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-header uppercase tracking-wide text-lg mb-2">
          Your Rights
        </h2>
        <p>
          Depending on your location, you may have rights to access, correct,
          delete, or restrict processing of your personal information. To
          exercise these rights, use the contact form on this Site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-header uppercase tracking-wide text-lg mb-2">
          Children
        </h2>
        <p>
          The Site is not directed at children under 13 (or the applicable age
          in your jurisdiction). We do not knowingly collect personal
          information from children.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-header uppercase tracking-wide text-lg mb-2">
          Changes to This Policy
        </h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The “Last
          updated” date at the top will reflect any changes. Continued use of
          the Site after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-header uppercase tracking-wide text-lg mb-2">
          Contact Us
        </h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this Privacy Policy or your data? Use the <a
            href="/contact"
            class="text-gold hover:underline">contact form</a
          >.
        </p>
      </section>

      <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm pt-4">
        Official Nugzz Crew • officialnugzzcrew.com • Built for The Fam Bam
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
